<title>FRANCE: Gaz et Eaux first half profits rise.</title>
<headline>Gaz et Eaux first half profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(In millions of francs)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		   338  vs	   192.4</p>
<p>NOTE: French holding company Gaz et Eaux said in a statement the net consolidated result included 201 million francs of financial and exceptional profits compared with 59.6 million for the corresponding year earlier period. It said the net re-evaluated asset value of Gaz et Eaux as of September 30 was 9.84 billion francs or 3.354 francs per share.</p>
</text>
